@description ReaGBA
@version 0.0.9
@author zaibuyidao
@link
  https://forum.cockos.com/showthread.php?t=311202
@provides
  [win64 extension] reaper_reagba-x64.dll https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/extension/reaper_reagba-x64.dll
  [darwin64 extension] reaper_reagba-x86_64.dylib https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/extension/reaper_reagba-x86_64.dylib
  [darwin-arm64 extension] reaper_reagba-arm64.dylib https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/extension/reaper_reagba-arm64.dylib
  [linux64 extension] reaper_reagba-x86_64.so https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/extension/reaper_reagba-x86_64.so
  [linux-aarch64 extension] reaper_reagba-aarch64.so https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/extension/reaper_reagba-aarch64.so

  [script main] web/zaibuyidao_ReaGBA.lua https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/web/zaibuyidao_ReaGBA.lua
  [script nomain] web/app.js https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/web/app.js
  [script nomain] web/i18n.js https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/web/i18n.js
  [script nomain] web/index.html https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/web/index.html
  [script nomain] web/style.css https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zaibuyidao/ReaScripts/$commit/Modules/ReaGBA/web/style.css
@changelog
  ReaGBA is a native GBA emulation extension built on ReaWebAPI.
  Play GBA games with native frame streaming, low-latency input, save states, and WebView-based controls.
  Requires ReaWebAPI. Run zaibuyidao_ReaGBA.lua from the Action List.
